Package: dtab
Title: Descriptive and Crosstabulation Tables for Survey Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joe", "Crowley", email = "joeac121@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes weighted and unweighted descriptive statistics
    (means, medians, sums, percentages, counts) broken down by one or more
    predictors, with optional confidence intervals, significance tests, and
    pairwise (letter-based) significance testing against survey-weighted
    designs via the 'survey' package. Reshapes the results into publication-
    ready crosstabulation, summary, battery-grid, and numeric-summary tables
    (via 'huxtable'), and exports them to Excel.
